      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a decent start. It's professional enough.\n\nHowever, I just ran it through our sentiment tool and the score is actually kind of low—around 0.4. For a client this sensitive, we really need to make sure the brand comes across as warm and welcoming, even when we're apologizing. \n\nCan you try another version? Try to boost that positivity score a bit more so it doesn't feel so cold or clinical. Just remember what I said before: don't go overboard with the \"happy\" language or it'll look fake, but we definitely need it to feel more upbeat and positive than this first one.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
